HJASSEMBLY LANGUAGE PROGRAM

This demonstration shows the use of OS/78 Assembly Language.

The program we will write, assemble, and run will be a very
simple one:  it will add 2 and 3 to get 5 and print the 5.

First will come the program listing. After that the program will
be assembled and run (under BATCH) and the resulting "5" should
print on the screen.

		...Executing under OS/78 BATCH!
